---
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Connections from '../components/Connections.astro';
import {current,groups} from '../lib/connections';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import Code from '../components/Code.astro';
import DeployButton from '../components/DeployButton.astro';
import Workbench from '../components/Workbench.astro';
import DuckDb from '../components/DuckDb.astro';
import ConnectAgent from '../components/ConnectAgent.astro';
import AgentLinks from '../components/AgentLinks.astro';
import {githubUrl,discordUrl} from '../lib/links.mjs';
import PriceStrip from '../components/PriceStrip.astro';
import {count,freePlanEventsPerMonth} from '../lib/pricing.mjs';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import flagship from '../assets/reports/export-health.png';
import retention from '../assets/reports/retention.png';
import activation from '../assets/reports/activation.png';
import recovery from '../assets/reports/recovery.png';
import engagement from '../assets/reports/engagement.png';
import releaseCompare from '../assets/reports/release-compare.png';
import formats from '../assets/reports/formats.png';
import funnel from '../assets/reports/funnel.png';
import formatsDark from '../assets/reports/formats-dark.png';
import byRelease from '../assets/reports/by-release.png';
import byReleaseSource from '../../../../examples/demo/by-release.md?raw';
import activatedPeople from '../../../../examples/definitions/activated_people.sql?raw';
import snippets from '../../../../docs/onboarding/snippets.json';
const sections=[{id:'loop',label:'The improvement loop'},{id:'reports',label:'Reports'},{id:'markdown',label:'Markdown'},{id:'definitions',label:'Definitions'},{id:'code',label:'In code'},{id:'connections',label:'Connections'},{id:'tools',label:'Your toolkit'}];
---
<Page title="Let your agent improve your app" description="Set the goals. Your agent chooses what to track, learns from real usage, improves your product, and measures what happens next. Your data stays in your Cloudflare account." current="home" sections={sections}>
<header class="hero">
<ul class="diff" aria-label="What makes Slurp different"><li><Icon name="code"/>Open source</li><li><Icon name="cloud"/>Your own Cloudflare account</li><li class="duck"><DuckDb size={17}/>Local analysis with DuckDB</li></ul>
<div class="hero-grid">
<div class="copy">
<h1>Let your agent autonomously<br/><span class="hot">improve your app.</span></h1>
<p class="lede">Set the goals. Your agent figures out what to track, learns from real usage, and keeps improving your product. Slurp gives it the data to see what worked—and what to try next.</p>
<aside class="free" id="start" aria-labelledby="free-title"><span class="free-mark" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="cloud"/></span><div><h2 id="free-title">Start free.</h2><p>Cloudflare's free plan covers about <strong>{count(freePlanEventsPerMonth())} events a month</strong>. Slurp itself costs nothing.</p></div></aside>
<div class="actions"><DeployButton id="home" cli={false}/><ConnectAgent/><span class="hero-links">{[{icon:'github',label:'GitHub',href:githubUrl},{icon:'discord',label:'Discord',href:discordUrl}].filter(l=>l.href).map(l=><a href={l.href} rel="noopener" aria-label={l.label} title={l.label}><Icon name={l.icon}/></a>)}</span></div>
<p class="free-note">Prefer a terminal? <button type="button" class="free-cli" data-deploy-open="home">Install with the CLI instead ↗</button></p>
<AgentLinks/><button class="feedback-hero" type="button" data-feedback-open>Tell our agents what to improve ↗</button>
</div>
<a class="snapshot" href="/reports/export-health/" aria-label="Open the live sample report: Why do large exports fail?">
<figure><div class="crop"><Image src={flagship} width={1680} widths={[640,920,1260,1680]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 460px, 92vw" format="webp" quality={92} alt="A report written by a coding agent: export completion by week drops from 94% to 79% when v1.2.4 ships, then recovers" loading="eager"/></div><figcaption><span>Written by an agent from your data</span><span>Sample data · Open the live report ↗</span></figcaption></figure>
</a>
</div>
<PriceStrip/>
</header>
<section class="section" id="loop">
<span class="section-number">01 / THE IMPROVEMENT LOOP</span>
<h2>You set the goal. Your agent works the loop.</h2>
<p>More revenue. More people getting value. Fewer failed exports. Give your agent an outcome to work toward, and let real usage guide the next change.</p>
<Workbench/>
<p class="fine">Goals and dated learnings live in <code>slurp/GOALS.md</code>, alongside your code. Your agent picks up where it left off each time it runs. For recurring work, use your agent’s routines or an external scheduler.</p>
<a class="btn" href="/agents/#first-run">Start your first improvement loop ↗</a>
</section>
<section class="feedback-demo" id="feedback"><div><p class="eyebrow">Real feedback. Real product learning.</p><h2>Tell our agents what to improve.</h2><p>Slurp captures what people say alongside what they do. This form uses Slurp too—your message becomes feedback our agents can investigate.</p></div><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-feedback-open>Try it out here ↗</button></section>
<section class="section" id="reports">
<span class="section-number">02 / REPORTS</span>
<h2>What your agent hands back.</h2>
<p>Ask about retention, onboarding, failures or your latest release. Your agent turns the data into reports you can explore and share.</p>
<div class="gallery">
<a href="/reports/export-health/"><Image src={flagship} width={840} widths={[420,840]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 300px, 90vw" alt="Report: export completion by week and by file size, with a table of failure reasons" loading="lazy"/><span><b>Why export completion dropped</b></span></a>
<a href="/reports/retention/"><Image src={retention} width={840} widths={[420,840]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 300px, 90vw" alt="Report: weekly retention cohort heatmap and a free versus pro retention curve" loading="lazy"/><span><b>Do new users come back?</b></span></a>
<a href="/reports/activation/"><Image src={activation} width={840} widths={[420,840]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 300px, 90vw" alt="Report: signup to first export funnel by plan and time to first export" loading="lazy"/><span><b>How fast do new users get value?</b></span></a>
<a href="/reports/recovery/"><Image src={recovery} width={840} widths={[420,840]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 300px, 90vw" alt="Report: how soon people recover after a failed export and what they do next" loading="lazy"/><span><b>What happens after a failure?</b></span></a>
<a href="/reports/engagement/"><Image src={engagement} width={840} widths={[420,840]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 300px, 90vw" alt="Report: visit length, exports per person and active people over time" loading="lazy"/><span><b>How engaged are people?</b></span></a>
<a href="/reports/formats/"><Image src={formats} width={840} widths={[420,840]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 300px, 90vw" alt="Report: donut of export formats, bars of export time and a log scatter of size against time" loading="lazy"/><span><b>What are people exporting?</b></span></a>
<a href="/reports/funnel/"><Image src={funnel} width={840} widths={[420,840]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 300px, 90vw" alt="Report: export funnel, completion by format and weekly activity as overlaid areas" loading="lazy"/><span><b>Where does the flow leak?</b></span></a>
<a href="/reports/release-compare/"><Image src={releaseCompare} width={840} widths={[420,840]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 300px, 90vw" alt="Report: release comparison with failure reasons and weekly sign-ups" loading="lazy"/><span><b>How did each release do?</b></span></a>
<a href="/reports/formats-dark/"><Image src={formatsDark} width={840} widths={[420,840]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 300px, 90vw" alt="Report: the formats report in the Pro Dark theme" loading="lazy"/><span><b>The same report, Pro Dark</b></span></a>
</div>
<p class="fine">Sample data from a fictional app, generated by <code>examples/demo</code> and loaded through a real Worker. Nothing here is customer data.</p>
</section>
<section class="section" id="markdown">
<span class="section-number">03 / MARKDOWN</span>
<h2>Your agent writes the report in Markdown.</h2>
<p>Reports are Markdown with SQL attached, so you can check every finding. Export self-contained HTML, PNG or PDF.</p>
<div class="source-output">
<Code label="by-release.md" code={byReleaseSource.trim()}/>
<figure><Image src={byRelease} width={840} widths={[420,840]} sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 420px, 90vw" alt="The rendered chart: exports completed by release, with v1.2.4 lower than the others" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>What <code>slurp report build</code> makes from it</figcaption></figure>
</div>
<Code label="Terminal" code={`slurp report check report.md
slurp report build report.md --out ./report --png --pdf
slurp report open ./report`}/>
</section>
<section class="section" id="definitions">
<span class="section-number">04 / DEFINITIONS</span>
<h2>Define your numbers once.</h2>
<p>Who counts as active? Do test accounts count? Write the answer as a small SQL file in your app's repository. Your agent, your reports and your teammates all use it, so the same question gets the same number every time.</p>
<Code label="slurp/definitions/activated_people.sql" code={activatedPeople.trim()}/>
<div class="definition-pair">
<Code label="Any query, report or agent session" code={`SELECT plan, count(*) AS activated
FROM activated_people(within := INTERVAL 3 DAY)
GROUP BY plan`}/>
<ul class="points">
<li><b>Plain DuckDB SQL.</b> A macro or a view, reviewed in pull requests like the rest of your code.</li>
<li><b>Everywhere at once.</b> <code>slurp sql</code>, reports, the MCP server and <code>slurp duckdb</code> load them. Nothing is stored in your database.</li>
<li><b>Checked.</b> <code>slurp definitions</code> lists them and names any file that does not load or would replace a built-in.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<p class="fine">More in the <a href="/docs/#definitions">quickstart</a>. Your agent's skill tells it to reuse definitions and to save the ones you agree on.</p>
</section>
<section class="section" id="code">
<span class="section-number">05 / IN CODE</span>
<h2>A few lines. Real events.</h2>
<p>A publishable key sends events. Your read key brings them home.</p>
<Code label="JavaScript / Node" code={snippets.sdk}/>
<p class="fine">Install with <code>npm install @hitslop/slurp-sdk</code>. The <a href="/docs/#capture">quickstart</a> has the full snippet, and any language can send events over HTTP.</p>
</section>
<section class="section" id="connections"><span class="section-number">06 / CONNECTIONS</span><h2>Bring more of your stack.</h2><p>Use the Slurp SDKs, keep your Segment or Sentry SDK, or send events over HTTP.</p><Connections items={[...current.slice(0,6),...groups.find(g=>g.id==='business')!.items.slice(0,2)]}/><a class="btn" href="/connections/">All connections and ideas ↗</a></section><section class="section" id="tools"><span class="section-number">07 / YOUR TOOLKIT</span><h2>Put your product data to work.</h2><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/docs/">Get started ↗</a></div></section>
</Page>
<style>
.feedback-demo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;justify-content:space-between;margin:48px 0;padding:32px;border:1px solid #f6b8c3;border-radius:14px;background:#fff5f7}.feedback-demo h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);margin:0 0 12px}.feedback-demo p{max-width:620px}.feedback-demo .btn{flex:none;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer}.feedback-hero{border:0;background:none;color:var(--red);font:650 13px var(--body);padding:12px 0;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:700px){.feedback-demo{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;padding:24px;gap:12px}}

.hero{padding-bottom:6px}
.diff{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;list-style:none;margin:0 0 22px;padding:0}
.diff li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:999px;font:650 12px var(--body);letter-spacing:.01em;background:#fff}
.diff li :global(.icon){width:15px;height:15px;color:var(--red)}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(0,.92fr);gap:28px;align-items:center}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,4.4vw,60px);margin-bottom:16px}
.hero .lede{font-size:clamp(16px,1.35vw,18px);max-width:520px;margin-bottom:20px}
.hero .actions{margin:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px 12px}
.hero .actions .btn{box-sizing:border-box;height:39px;padding-block:0;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}
.hero .actions .hero-links{margin-left:2px}
.free{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin:24px 0 18px;padding:16px 22px 16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff4f5,#ffe8ec);border:1.5px solid #f6b8c3;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #e8002a14}
.free-mark{flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #fbd3b4;color:#f6821f}
.free-mark :global(.icon){width:32px;height:32px;stroke-width:1.7}
.free h2{margin:0;font:800 clamp(26px,3vw,36px)/1 var(--display);font-stretch:75%;color:var(--red)}
.free p{margin:6px 0 0;font:500 16px/1.4 var(--body);color:var(--ink)}
.free strong{font-weight:800}
@media(max-width:560px){.free{align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:14px}.free-mark{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px}.free-mark :global(.icon){width:26px;height:26px}.free p{font-size:15px}}
.free-note{margin:14px 0 0;font:500 13.5px/1.5 var(--body);color:var(--muted)}.free-note strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
.free-cli{position:relative;border:0;background:none;padding:0;font:inherit;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
.free-cli::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:-12px -6px}.free-cli:hover{color:var(--red)}
.snapshot{display:block;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.snapshot figure{margin:0;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 14px 40px #17191c1f;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.snapshot:hover figure{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 18px 48px #17191c2e}
.crop{height:clamp(420px,41vw,590px);overflow:hidden;background:#f4f4f4}
.crop :global(img){display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin-top:-4.3%}
.snapshot figcaption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:9px 14px;font:600 11.5px var(--body);color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
.snapshot figcaption span:last-child{color:var(--red)}
.how{margin:34px 0 0;font:700 13px var(--body);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.hero-links{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;margin-left:4px}.hero-links a{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:50%;color:var(--muted);transition:color .15s,border-color .15s}.hero-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink)}.hero-links .icon{width:17px;height:17px}
.steps.four{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}.steps.four>div+div{padding-left:18px}.steps.four code{display:block;margin-top:10px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
@media(max-width:900px){.steps.four{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.steps.four>div:nth-child(3){border-left:0;padding-left:0}}
@media(max-width:560px){.steps.four{display:block}.steps.four>div+div{padding:20px 0 0;border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:20px}}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:22px 0 10px}
.gallery a{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;background:#fff;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.gallery a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 32px #17191c24}
.gallery :global(img){display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:840/700;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;margin-top:-4.3%;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);background:#f4f4f4}
.gallery span{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.gallery b{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink)}
.source-output{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,.9fr);gap:18px;align-items:start;margin:20px 0}
.source-output figure{margin:0;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}
.source-output figure :global(img){display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.source-output figcaption{padding:9px 14px;font:600 11.5px var(--body);color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
.definition-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:18px;align-items:start;margin:0 0 6px}
.definition-pair :global(.codebox){margin:0}
.points{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:12px}
.points li{padding-left:16px;border-left:2px solid var(--red);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5}
.points b{color:var(--ink)}
@media(max-width:1000px){.hero-grid,.source-output,.definition-pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
